UID:volleyball-1@danversfalconsathletics.org
DTSTAMP:20260801T000000Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260907T123000
DURATION:PT2H
SUMMARY:Danvers Volleyball at Barnstable (L 0–3)
LOCATION:Barnstable High School\, Hyannis
DESCRIPTION:Non-league\nFinal: Danvers 0\, Barnstable 3\nThe Sarah Griffin 
 era opened with a Labor Day trip to Cape Cod. Gabrielle Lindeman had eight
  kills and Hadley Brown 12 digs\, but Barnstable took it in three.\nSchedu
 le and results: https://danversfalconsathletics.org/volleyball/schedule.ht
 ml
URL:https://danversfalconsathletics.org/volleyball/schedule.html
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:volleyball-2@danversfalconsathletics.org
DTSTAMP:20260801T000000Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260909T171500
DURATION:PT2H
SUMMARY:Danvers Volleyball at Triton (W 3–0)
LOCATION:Triton Regional HS\, Byfield
DESCRIPTION:Non-league\nFinal: Danvers 3\, Triton 0\nDanvers served its way
  to Sarah Griffin's first win with 19 aces\, six from Lauren Garofalo and 
 five from Hadley Brown. Gabrielle Lindeman had seven kills and 12 digs\, a
 nd setters Hannah Tersolo and Lila Osborne each handed out 11 assists.\nSc
 hedule and results: https://danversfalconsathletics.org/volleyball/schedul
 e.html
URL:https://danversfalconsathletics.org/volleyball/schedule.html
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:volleyball-3@danversfalconsathletics.org
DTSTAMP:20260801T000000Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260910T171500
DURATION:PT2H
SUMMARY:Danvers Volleyball vs Gloucester (W 3–0)
LOCATION:DHS Field House\, Danvers
DESCRIPTION:Non-league\nFinal: Danvers 3\, Gloucester 0\nThe home opener wa
 s a sweep. The Falcons hit .267 as a team\, with seven kills from Gabriell
 e Lindeman\, six aces from Lauren Garofalo and 14 assists from Hannah Ters
 olo.\nSchedule and results: https://danversfalconsathletics.org/volleyball
 /schedule.html
URL:https://danversfalconsathletics.org/volleyball/schedule.html
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:volleyball-4@danversfalconsathletics.org
DTSTAMP:20260801T000000Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260914T173000
DURATION:PT2H
SUMMARY:Danvers Volleyball at Marblehead (L 0–3)
LOCATION:Marblehead High School
DESCRIPTION:Northeastern Conference\nFinal: Danvers 0\, Marblehead 3\nMarbl
 ehead took the conference opener in three sets. Sienna Lynch led the Falco
 ns with three kills and a block\, and Hannah Tersolo had two aces and thre
 e assists.\nSchedule and results: https://danversfalconsathletics.org/voll
 eyball/schedule.html
URL:https://danversfalconsathletics.org/volleyball/schedule.html
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:volleyball-5@danversfalconsathletics.org
DTSTAMP:20260801T000000Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260916T171500
DURATION:PT2H
SUMMARY:Danvers Volleyball vs Stoneham (W 3–0)
LOCATION:DHS Field House\, Danvers
DESCRIPTION:Non-league\nFinal: Danvers 3\, Stoneham 0\nGabrielle Lindeman s
 erved nine aces to go with six kills and 20 digs\, and Hannah Tersolo had 
 17 assists and 10 digs\, as the Falcons gave up just five points in the se
 cond set.\nSchedule and results: https://danversfalconsathletics.org/volle
 yball/schedule.html
URL:https://danversfalconsathletics.org/volleyball/schedule.html
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:volleyball-6@danversfalconsathletics.org
DTSTAMP:20260801T000000Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260917T171500
DURATION:PT2H
SUMMARY:Danvers Volleyball at Gloucester (W 3–2)
LOCATION:Gloucester HS Field House
DESCRIPTION:Non-league\nFinal: Danvers 3\, Gloucester 2\nA week after sweep
 ing Gloucester\, the Falcons needed all five sets in the rematch. Kendall 
 Murphy had five aces\, three blocks and three kills\, Lauren Garofalo eigh
 t kills\, and Danvers served 25 aces as a team before closing out the fift
 h set 15–9.\nSchedule and results: https://danversfalconsathletics.org/v
 olleyball/schedule.html
URL:https://danversfalconsathletics.org/volleyball/schedule.html
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:volleyball-7@danversfalconsathletics.org
DTSTAMP:20260801T000000Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260923T171500
DURATION:PT2H
SUMMARY:Danvers Volleyball vs Beverly (W 3–0)
LOCATION:DHS Field House\, Danvers
DESCRIPTION:Northeastern Conference\nFinal: Danvers 3\, Beverly 0\nTwo 25
 –23 sets decided a tight rivalry match at the Field House. Gabrielle Lin
 deman and Lauren Garofalo each had eight kills\, and setters Hannah Tersol
 o and Lila Osborne finished with 14 assists apiece.\nSchedule and results:
  https://danversfalconsathletics.org/volleyball/schedule.html
URL:https://danversfalconsathletics.org/volleyball/schedule.html
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:volleyball-8@danversfalconsathletics.org
DTSTAMP:20260801T000000Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260925T173000
DURATION:PT2H
SUMMARY:Danvers Volleyball at Peabody (W 3–1)
LOCATION:Peabody Veterans Memorial HS
DESCRIPTION:Northeastern Conference\nFinal: Danvers 3\, Peabody 1\nDanvers 
 dropped the first set and then won three straight. Lauren Garofalo and Tes
 s Crowley each put down 11 kills\, Hadley Brown had 23 digs\, and Hannah T
 ersolo and Lila Osborne combined for 33 assists.\nSchedule and results: ht
 tps://danversfalconsathletics.org/volleyball/schedule.html
URL:https://danversfalconsathletics.org/volleyball/schedule.html
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:volleyball-9@danversfalconsathletics.org
DTSTAMP:20260801T000000Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260928T173000
DURATION:PT2H
SUMMARY:Danvers Volleyball at Saugus (W 3–0)
LOCATION:Saugus Middle High School
DESCRIPTION:Northeastern Conference\nFinal: Danvers 3\, Saugus 0\nGabrielle
  Lindeman put down 12 kills\, Lauren Garofalo added eight with 11 digs\, a
 nd Hannah Tersolo had 17 assists in a sweep\, the Falcons' fifth win in a 
 row.\nSchedule and results: https://danversfalconsathletics.org/volleyball
 /schedule.html
URL:https://danversfalconsathletics.org/volleyball/schedule.html
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:volleyball-10@danversfalconsathletics.org
DTSTAMP:20260801T000000Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260930T173000
DURATION:PT2H
SUMMARY:Danvers Volleyball at Masconomet (W 3–2)
LOCATION:Masconomet Regional HS\, Boxford
DESCRIPTION:Northeastern Conference\nFinal: Danvers 3\, Masconomet 2\nDanve
 rs won the first two sets\, watched the Chieftains force a fifth\, then st
 eadied itself to take it 15–11. Gabrielle Lindeman had 10 kills and 25 d
 igs\, Hadley Brown 21 digs\, and Brooke Bernard five blocks.\nSchedule and
  results: https://danversfalconsathletics.org/volleyball/schedule.html
URL:https://danversfalconsathletics.org/volleyball/schedule.html
END:VEVENT
