DURATION:PT2H
SUMMARY:Danvers Volleyball vs Bishop Fenwick (W 3–0)
LOCATION:DHS Field House\, Danvers
DESCRIPTION:Non-league\nFinal: Danvers 3\, Bishop Fenwick 0\nA comfortable 
 sweep at the Field House. Lauren Garofalo had six kills and nine digs\, Ha
 nnah Tersolo handed out 16 assists\, and the Falcons served 15 aces.\nSche
 dule and results: https://danversfalconsathletics.org/volleyball/schedule.
 html
