DTSTAMP:20260801T000000Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261007T174500
DURATION:PT2H
SUMMARY:Danvers Volleyball at Winthrop (W 3–2)
LOCATION:Winthrop High School
DESCRIPTION:Northeastern Conference\nFinal: Danvers 3\, Winthrop 2\nThe Fal
 cons' third five-set win of the season was also their eighth victory in a 
 row. Gabrielle Lindeman had 14 kills\, six aces and 23 digs\, Lauren Garof
 alo 11 kills\, and Hannah Tersolo 21 assists.\nSchedule and results: https
 ://danversfalconsathletics.org/volleyball/schedule.html
URL:https://danversfalconsathletics.org/volleyball/schedule.html
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:volleyball-13@danversfalconsathletics.org
DTSTAMP:20260801T000000Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261009T173000
DURATION:PT2H
SUMMARY:Danvers Volleyball at Stoneham (W 3–0)
LOCATION:Stoneham High School
DESCRIPTION:Non-league\nFinal: Danvers 3\, Stoneham 0\nDanvers swept Stoneh
 am for the second time this season and hit .302\, its best attacking night
  of the year. Gabrielle Lindeman had nine kills and 12 digs\, Kendall Murp
 hy five kills and five blocks\, and Hannah Tersolo 17 assists as the Falco
 ns served 13 aces.\nSchedule and results: https://danversfalconsathletics.
 org/volleyball/schedule.html
URL:https://danversfalconsathletics.org/volleyball/schedule.html
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:volleyball-14@danversfalconsathletics.org
DTSTAMP:20260801T000000Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261012T103000
DURATION:PT2H
SUMMARY:Danvers Volleyball vs Mystic Valley (W 3–0)
LOCATION:DHS Field House\, Danvers
DESCRIPTION:Non-league\nFinal: Danvers 3\, Mystic Valley 0\nBrooke Bernard 
 led a Monday-morning sweep with 10 kills\, three aces and two blocks. Gabr
 ielle Lindeman served seven aces to go with 20 digs\, Lauren Garofalo had 
 13 digs and 22 serve receptions\, and Hannah Tersolo handed out 20 assists
 .\nSchedule and results: https://danversfalconsathletics.org/volleyball/sc
 hedule.html
URL:https://danversfalconsathletics.org/volleyball/schedule.html
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:volleyball-15@danversfalconsathletics.org
DTSTAMP:20260801T000000Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261014T171500
DURATION:PT2H
SUMMARY:Danvers Volleyball vs Marblehead (L 1–3)
LOCATION:DHS Field House\, Danvers
DESCRIPTION:Northeastern Conference\nFinal: Danvers 1\, Marblehead 3\nThe F
 alcons took the first set 25–19\, but Marblehead won the next three to c
 omplete a season sweep and end Danvers' 10-match winning streak. Gabrielle
  Lindeman had eight kills\, 26 digs and 36 serve receptions\, Hadley Brown
  added 25 digs and Lila Osborne 19.\nSchedule and results: https://danvers
 falconsathletics.org/volleyball/schedule.html
URL:https://danversfalconsathletics.org/volleyball/schedule.html
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:volleyball-16@danversfalconsathletics.org
DTSTAMP:20260801T000000Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261019T173000
DURATION:PT2H
SUMMARY:Danvers Volleyball at Beverly (L 2–3)
LOCATION:Beverly High School
DESCRIPTION:Northeastern Conference\nFinal: Danvers 2\, Beverly 3\nDanvers 
 came back from nine points down to win a 29–27 first set and forced a fi
 fth after dropping the next two\, but Beverly pulled away late in the deci
 ding set to split the rivalry series. Lauren Garofalo had nine kills\, thr
 ee aces and 24 digs\, Brooke Bernard seven kills and two blocks\, and Kend
 all Murphy four aces.\nSchedule and results: https://danversfalconsathleti
 cs.org/volleyball/schedule.html
URL:https://danversfalconsathletics.org/volleyball/schedule.html
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:volleyball-17@danversfalconsathletics.org
DTSTAMP:20260801T000000Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261021T171500
DURATION:PT2H
SUMMARY:Danvers Volleyball vs Swampscott (L 2–3)
LOCATION:DHS Field House\, Danvers
DESCRIPTION:Northeastern Conference\nFinal: Danvers 2\, Swampscott 3\nDanve
 rs took the first two sets\, 26–24 and 25–18\, but Swampscott won the 
 next three. Gabrielle Lindeman dug 37 balls and took 28 serve receptions\,
  Lauren Garofalo had nine kills and 18 digs\, Brooke Bernard eight kills\,
  Kendall Murphy seven kills without an error\, and Hannah Tersolo 20 assis
 ts.\nSchedule and results: https://danversfalconsathletics.org/volleyball/
 schedule.html
URL:https://danversfalconsathletics.org/volleyball/schedule.html
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:volleyball-18@danversfalconsathletics.org
DTSTAMP:20260801T000000Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261026T171500
DURATION:PT2H
SUMMARY:Danvers Volleyball vs Peabody (W 3–0)
LOCATION:DHS Field House\, Danvers
DESCRIPTION:Northeastern Conference\nFinal: Danvers 3\, Peabody 0\nDanvers 
 snapped a three-match skid with a sweep of Peabody\, 25–11\, 25–12\, 2
 5–16. The Falcons served 21 aces\, eight of them from Lauren Garofalo\, 
 and had 24 kills\, seven from Gabrielle Lindeman. Hadley Brown added 14 di
 gs and four aces.\nSchedule and results: https://danversfalconsathletics.o
 rg/volleyball/schedule.html
URL:https://danversfalconsathletics.org/volleyball/schedule.html
END:VEVENT
