DURATION:PT2H
SUMMARY:Danvers Volleyball vs Masconomet (W 3–0)
LOCATION:DHS Field House\, Danvers
DESCRIPTION:Northeastern Conference\nFinal: Danvers 3\, Masconomet 0\nDanve
 rs made it two wins in a row with a sweep of Masconomet\, 25–15\, 25–2
 2\, 25–20. Gabrielle Lindeman had 14 digs\, six aces and two solo blocks
 \, and Lauren Garofalo added six kills\, 14 digs and four aces.\nSchedule 
 and results: https://danversfalconsathletics.org/volleyball/schedule.html
